ction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-01-09\nValid as Of: 2025-01-10\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 1660 ---\nComponent: Availability Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Option to Deactivate/Activate monitors\nDescription: AvS offers the option to temporarily deactivate and (re-)activate the execution of measurements on the tester services. On a monitor level you can do it in the monitor details menu. For API usage, use the endpoint /v2/evaluationmetadata/{evaluationId}/lifecycle with the lifecycle options INACTIVE and ACTIVE respectively.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Announcement\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2025-01-09\nValid as Of: 2025-01-09\nVersion: Cloud\n\n\",702\n145,\"--- Record 2981 ---\nComponent: UI Theme Designer\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Migrating Themes\nDescription: On the welcome screen, you can now migrate existing custom themes based on a different SAP standard theme. For more information, see Migrating Themes and Migrate Your Themes with Ease.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-01\nValid as Of: 2024-05-08\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2982 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: Telemetry module: Update to version 1.14.0\nDescription: The new version brings the following improvements:      Logs, Traces, and Metrics: To use the memory limits more efficiently, the resource setup has been improved for all components. (#804)      Logs: Improved status message for LogPipeline if the used certificate is invalid (#996).      Traces, Metrics: You can now easily detect whether there is an invalid or expired client certificate, because the TracePipeline and MetricPipeline status shows what's wrong (#930).    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-04-23\nValid as Of: 2024-05-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2983 ---\nComponent: SAP Datasphere\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Features for Version 2024.10\nDescription: New and changed features are available for administration, data integration, data marketplace, and data modeling.  For more information, see What's New in SAP Datasphere 2024.10. \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-05-07\nValid as Of: 2024-05-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2984 ---\nComponent: SAP S/⁠4HANA Cloud for Credit Integration\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Integration with new credit agency: Cerved Group S.p.A.\nDescription: The credit agency Cerved Group S.p.A. is now connected to SAP S/⁠4HANA Cloud for credit integration.   More information:  New SAP Note: 3444411 : BC set UKM_BVD_2_CONF for Cerved  Configure Rating Procedures  Available Credit Agency Products and Features    Your Tasks for Integrating a New Credit Agency  \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Finance\nLatest Revision: 2024-05-07\nValid as Of: 2024-05-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2985 ---\nComponent: Service Ticket Intelligence\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Consuming the Service via AI API (Beta)\nDescription: The following operations are now no longer available:    Create Execution: POST  {{sti_service_url}}/v2/lm/configurations/{{configuration_id}}/executions      Deploy Model: POST  {{sti_service_url}}/v2/lm/configurations/{{configuration_id}}/deployments      See Consuming the Service via AI API (Beta).\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: Beta\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-05-06\nValid as Of: 2024-05-06\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2986 ---\nComponent: Pricing Service\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Extension Concept - Proper Size-Based Cache Eviction\nDescription: Calls to extension implementations are cached, so that ca